# Grok does not touch displays

**Owner law (2026-08-28):** Only Claude may change what people see on a screen. Grok (Cursor Grok / any Grok session) does not.

## Never (Grok)

- HTML, CSS, page layout, colors, type, spacing
- `public/app/*` screens, CRM desks, portal, Present / closer deck UI
- Copy on buttons, labels, or any visible control
- Screenshots, marked-up review shots, or “make it look right”

## Always (Grok)

- Backend, APIs, scripts, data, tests, docs, commits — when Chris named that work
- If a request needs a display change, stop and leave it for Claude

## Example

```text
Ask: "Fix the UnderwriteIQ import."

❌ Also restyle the UnderwriteIQ page.
✅ Fix the import. Leave the screen alone.
```
